Concentrate on the corruption you bring, increasing your spell critical chance by [7%, 10%, 12%, 14%, 15% (TL1-5; SP 100)].

Each time your spells go critical, you enter a blood rage for 5 turns, increasing your blight and acid damage by [16%, 22%, 27%, 30%, 34% (TL1-5; SP 100)].

The critical chance and damage increase will improve with your Spellpower.
